      "step_type": "intro",
      "title": "Grammar: 고 싶어요",
      "instruction": "Put 고 싶어요 after a verb to say what you want to do. Use it for 'I', and in questions for 'you'.",
      "content": {
        "explanation": {
          "title": "The verb stays the same",
          "patterns": [
            {
              "pattern": "verb + 고 싶어요",
              "level": "Essential",
              "usage": "It means 'want to'. Put 고 싶어요 right after the verb stem: 먹, 읽, 마시, 가. It is the same after a consonant or a vowel."
            }
          ]
        },
